    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tiredness from radiotherapy, improving; weight stable</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Frequency and nocturia twice, improving; no burning, blood, or retention</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Stools once or twice a day, softer than before, with mild urgency; no bleeding</td></tr><tr><td>Endocrine</td><td>Positive</td><td>Occasional hot flashes, fewer than before</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No dizziness on standing</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; PHQ-2 score 0</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>6 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

